{"ticker":"LCCPROJECT","symbol":"LCCPROJECT","instrumentId":3204278,"name":"Lcc Projects Ltd","industry":"NSE-Bldg-Heavy Construction","about":"LCC Projects provides engineering, procurement, and construction services, primarily for government irrigation, water supply, and infrastructure projects. Its capabilities include construction of dams, barrages, weirs, canals, hydraulic structures, pipe distribution networks, lift irrigation systems, water supply schemes, underground pipelines, roads, buildings, and electromechanical works. The company undertakes large scale infrastructure projects from engineering and procurement through construction and execution. As of March 31, 2026, its order book comprised 103 projects. LCC Projects has operations across 12 Indian states, including Gujarat, Madhya Pradesh, Odisha, Rajasthan, Maharashtra, Uttar Pradesh, Karnataka, Jharkhand, Chhattisgarh, Andhra Pradesh, Himachal Pradesh, and Haryana.","website":"www.lccprojects.com","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:37:56.387Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":123.94,"changePct":-1.7674566061662869,"week52High":170.1,"week52Low":0},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹3,590 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹2,853 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"28,967,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"24"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"13,043,453"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.00%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"5.57"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.4"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"7.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.74"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.24"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"100%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"11.85"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"16–18"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"36.8%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"5.83"},{"label":"Volume","value":"84,727"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"1,496,247"},{"label":"Master score","value":"26"},{"label":"EPS rating","value